        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> The `config.file` is specifically for [local sessions](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-sessions.txt#L18), i.e. for files inside current working directory.\n\nIt would be helpful to store the local sessions out of the local directory to not pollute it. I could get away with storing the session in .git folder as its ignored but this feels dirty. ",
